{"id":"skoree","lemma":"скорее","pos":"adv","rank":285,"glosses":["more exactly, more likely","be quick!"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/40/Ru-%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Я хочу уйти как можно скорее.","en":"I want to leave as soon as I can.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"to leave"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"it is impossible!"]]},{"text":"Она скорее милая, чем красивая.","en":"She is more pretty than beautiful.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},null,{"g":"dear, sweet","l":"милый"},{"g":"than"},{"g":"beautiful, handsome","l":"красивый"}]},{"text":"Том, скорее всего, внутри.","en":"Tom is likely to be in.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,{"g":"in total, in all"},{"g":"in, inside, within"}]},{"text":"Я скорее мёртв, чем жив.","en":"I feel more dead than alive.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"dead","l":"мёртвый"},{"g":"than"},{"g":"to live","l":"жить"}]},{"text":"Сделай это как можно скорее, пожалуйста.","en":"Please do it as soon as possible.","words":[{"g":"to make, to do","l":"сделать"},{"g":"this / it is"},null,null,null,{"g":"please"}],"phrases":[[2,4,"it is impossible!"]]}]}